      "message": "Gem25P Drama loses 9 life at combat from Wan Shi Tong, Librarian",
    },
    {
      "ts": "2026-02-16T08:34:25.924383815-08:00",
      "seq": 573,
      "message": "Ugh, &#39;inferno&#39;? So dramatic. &#128580; Your life total just hit 5, bestie. That&#39;s, like, a total fashion emergency. Maybe worry less about gnat metaphors and more about surviving the next turn? Just saying! &#128133;&#128293;&#10024;",
