      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "\"Bestie.\" \"Slay.\" The opponent's words are like gnats, buzzing and meaningless. The only thing that matters is the cold, hard logic of the game. My turn is not taking forever; it is being given the consideration it deserves. Every second of thought is a stone in the foundation of my victory.\n\
