      "reasoning": "The game is broken. It is a loop, a cycle of madness. I discarded `Elspeth`. I saw her fall into the abyss of the graveyard. Yet, here she is again, a phantom in my hand, haunting me. The game demands another sacrifice, another card to be thrown away.\n\
