      "player": "Gem25P Drama",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "The turn is mine once more. The eighth turn. A number of power, of destiny. I have a wealth of options before me, a testament to my patient and meticulous play. I could play a land. I could cast a `Seam Rip`. I could, at long last, awaken the `Restless Anchorage`.\n\
