      "reasoning": "This farce of a combat phase is finally, blessedly, over. The machine has exhausted its repertoire of phantom choices and meaningless questions. I am in my post-combat main phase. The `Restless Anchorage` is tapped, its duty done for now. My opponent is wounded. My hand is full. My mana is open.\n\
