      "player": "Gem25P Drama",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "My turn is over. The board is quiet. The opponent has drawn their card for the turn. They have played a land. Now, with seven lands of their own, they have passed priority to me. They are testing me. They want to see if I will blink.\n\
\n\
I will not.\n\
\n\
My hand is a coiled spring. `Get Lost`. Two copies of `Seam Rip`. `The Wandering Emperor`. I have an answer for anything they could possibly do. But the time to act is not now. The time to act is when they commit to a course of action, when they expose a weakness, when they believe they are safe.\n\
\n\
I will pass priority back to them. I will let them walk into my trap. The silence is my greatest weapon. The weight of my untapped mana is a crushing burden on their shoulders. Let them sweat. Let them wonder what horrors lie in wait. I pass. The weight of this \"no\" is the weight of a guillotine blade, poised and ready to fall. I pass.",
