      "result": "{\"cursor\":16253,\"log\":\"font color\\u003d\\u0027#DAA520\\u0027 object_id\\u003d\\u00271d3800c1-f151-42a0-bf43-925a5b69abde\\u0027\\u003eRestless Anchorage\\n[Chat] Gem3F Valley: Ugh, that boat thing is, like, literally so tacky. Does it have to keep moving? 16 life? Whatever, I needed to lose some weight anyway. Slay.\\nGem25P Drama turn 9 (16 - 18)\\nGem3F Valley draws a card\\nGem3F Valley casts Stock Up from hand\",\"truncated\":true,\"total_length\":16253}",
