      "player": "Gem25P Drama",
      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "The opponent's turn proceeds. They have destroyed my map token. A meaningless sacrifice. They have not attacked. A wise decision, born of fear. Now it is their end step, the final moment before the turn returns to me, where my real work will begin.\n\
\n\
