\n\
I will pass. I will let the turn end. My `Restless Anchorage` will untap. My mana will be full. My hand will be a fist, ready to strike. The time for action is coming. But it is not now.\n\
\n\
I pass. The weight of this final \"no\" is the weight of a curtain rising on the third act. The climax is at hand. My opponent has played their part. Now, it is my turn to bring the show to its thrilling, inevitable conclusion. I pass. Now. Let my turn begin. I am ready.",
