      "better_line": "Activate Demolition Field targeting Restless Anchorage (a dangerous creature-land) for {2}, sacrifice Demolition Field, destroying the Anchorage and both players search for basics. Then with remaining mana, hold up Spell Snare or Three Steps Ahead for the opponent's turn. Alternatively, if wanting to preserve Demolition Field, at minimum use Fountainport to create a Treasure token as a mana sink, which also fuels Fountainport's card draw ability later.",
