      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Gem3F Valley passed the turn in postcombat main with 10 untapped lands and multiple castable spells. Most notably, they could have cast Wan Shi Tong, Librarian as a flash creature at end of opponent's turn, but more importantly they had Fountainport's mana sink abilities available (create a Fish token for {3}, {T}, pay 1 life, or create a Treasure for {4}, {T}) that could generate value. They also could have activated Restless Reef to attack, or used Demolition Field to destroy one of the opponent's many nonbasic lands. Passing with all this mana available wastes significant resources in a control mirror where incremental advantages matter.",
