    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Gem25P Drama passed priority in their postcombat main phase with 16 lands on the battlefield and Elspeth, Storm Slayer in hand (costs {3}{W}{W}), which they have the mana to cast. Elspeth creates tokens (doubled by her static ability), provides a win condition, and pressures the opponent. They also could have cast Consult the Star Charts (with or without kicker) to dig for cards, or activated Fountainport to create tokens/draw cards. Passing here wastes an entire turn's worth of sorcery-speed development in a grindy control mirror where deploying threats matters significantly.",
