    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Gem25P Drama passed priority at end of turn without using mana sinks. They have Fountainport available (untapped, based on having two Fountainports on the battlefield) which could create a Fish token or Treasure token at instant speed on the opponent's end step. They also have Consult the Star Charts and Three Steps Ahead available as instant-speed card draw/selection that could be cast at end of opponent's turn. With 16 lands on the battlefield and the opponent tapped out, this was a prime opportunity to use mana productively.",
      "action_taken": "Passed priority without activating any abilities or casting any instant-speed spells.",
