      "decision_index": 236,
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Gem25P Drama passed priority during their own combat step without activating Restless Anchorage to attack. They have 16 lands on the battlefield, multiple untapped, and could have animated one or both Restless Anchorages (cost {1}{W}{U} each) to attack as 2/3 flyers. The opponent's Wan Shi Tong is a ground/air blocker with vigilance, but the Anchorages create Map tokens when attacking, providing incremental value. More importantly, the opponent has only 2 untapped lands (Undercity Sewers and Island), limiting their ability to interact. Passing without even attempting to pressure the opponent or generate Map tokens wastes a combat step in what appears to be a long, grindy game where incremental advantages matter.",
