    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Wan Shi Tong has flying and vigilance, making attacks essentially free against an opponent with no untapped flying blockers (opponent would need to spend mana activating Restless Anchorage). Not attacking wastes free damage in a control mirror where every point matters. The opponent is at 14 life and every attack chips away at their total.",
