      "better_line": "Attack with Wan Shi Tong, Librarian. With vigilance it stays untapped for blocking, and with flying the opponent would need to activate Restless Anchorage (costing them mana) or take damage. Could also activate Restless Reef as an additional attacker to pressure the opponent's life total.",
