    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Discarded Spell Snare over Deadly Cover-Up. Spell Snare provides efficient 1-mana countermagic against key opponent spells like Get Lost or No More Lies, while Deadly Cover-Up is actively counterproductive since Valley has the only creature (Wan Shi Tong) and the opponent has none. Deadly Cover-Up would destroy Valley's own win condition if cast.",
